<Slide notes={`Skill 保存的是方法，不是结果，这句话我想拆开讲清楚。

「读规则、查预约、生成候选、独立校验」这四步是方法。把它写进 SKILL.md，再把规则、脚本和数据结构放进同一个目录，方法就变成了可以随身携带的材料包。换一个活动，材料包不用重写，只换本次输入。

但结果不是材料包里写好的。本次人数多少、预约快照是哪一天、模型生成了什么、校验跑出什么，这几件事共同决定这次的方案对不对。同一个 Skill 两次运行一次通过一次不过，这不是它坏了。

还有两点容易搞混：安装了 Skill，不等于每次任务都会自动调用它；被调用了，也不等于业务结果一定正确。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>2.8.1　Skill 的几个组成部分</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>方法留下来，结果仍然重新决定</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 14 }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 250, height: 92, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 5, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>读规则</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>规则、brief 与输入材料</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 92, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text></Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 250, height: 92, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 5, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>查预约</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>指定日期的预约快照</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 92, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text></Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 250, height: 92, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 5, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>生成候选</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>保持活动 ID 与房间 ID</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 92, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#26816B' }}>›</Text></Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 250, height: 92, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 5, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>独立校验</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>运行 scripts 中的校验器</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 24, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#276FBF' }}>↓</Text></Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 82, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 46, background: '#276FBF' }} />
            <Box style={{ width: 250, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>材料包 skill/</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>方法写成文件，随包携带</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 1, height: 46, background: '#B5C7D8' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6, flex: 1 }}>SKILL.md 写操作说明　·　references/ 放规则与输入材料　·　scripts/ 放校验脚本　·　assets/ 放 schedule.schema.json</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
