            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 1, height: 46, background: '#B5C7D8' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6, flex: 1 }}>本次输入　＋　本次模型　＋　本次工具执行　→　本次的方案与报告</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>

            <Box style={{ width: 564, height: 112, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 60, background: '#CB6B28' }} />
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 5 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28' }}>已安装 ≠ 会自动调用</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>宿主只在任务与描述匹配时才选用；装了不等于每次都用上。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 564, height: 112, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 60, background: '#276FBF' }} />
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 5 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>会用 ≠ 业务结果正确</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>结果仍由本次输入、模型与工具执行共同决定，Skill 不打包结论。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>2.8 Skill：把一套方法做成可以重复使用的材料包</Text>
